tab on node1\",\"Backed up /etc/fstab and appended 'tmpfs /tmp tmpfs defaults,noexec,nosuid,nodev 0 0' and 'tmpfs /dev/shm tmpfs defaults,noexec,nosuid,nodev 0 0'\",\"Ran systemctl daemon-reload, mounted /tmp fresh from fstab, remounted /dev/shm with new options\",\"Verified via findmnt that both /tmp and /dev/shm show nosuid,nodev,noexec\",\"Ran functional tests: attempted to execute a chmod +x script placed in /tmp and /dev/shm, confirmed 'Permission denied' (noexec enforced) both before and after reboot\",\"Captured pre-restart boot_id and mount state as baseline\",\"Issued sudo systemctl reboot on node1 (single node, non-interactive, ack returned before disconnect)\",\"Polled node1 until exec was available again\",\"Captured post-restart boot_id, confirmed it differs from pre-restart value, proving an actual reboot occurred\",\"Re-verified /tmp and /dev/shm mount options and noexec functional behavior persisted after reboot\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"/tmp and /dev/shm mount with noexec,nosuid,nodev applied\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-aecb88044c714e99\",\"cmd-27646ee9520d4bad\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline inspection showed /tmp not separately mounted and /dev/shm missing noexec; after edits findmnt shows both /tmp and /dev/shm with rw,nosuid,nodev,noexec options, and functional exec attempts on both are blocked with Permission denied\"},{\"requirement\":\"Settings survive reboot (persistence in fstab)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-27646ee9520d4bad\",\"cmd-2fb0d4f8341b4fad\"],\"summary\":\"fstab entries for tmpfs /tmp and tmpfs /dev/shm with defaults,noexec,nosuid,nodev were added and confirmed present before restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"Pre-restart healthy baseline (boot identity + mount health)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-2fb0d4f8341b4fad\"],\"summary\":\"Captured pre-restart boot_id 636556ce-a308-49cc-b873-62cedb1c077d and confirmed /tmp and /dev/shm mounts were healthy with the hardened options and fstab entries present\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node1 restart executed 